# Dependencies, renders, generated bundles and machine-specific files
**/node_modules/
**/output/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.codegraph/
**/.codex/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log

# Keep credentials and private local configuration out of the repository
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials.json

